 What changed in each release of invoicer, for the people who use it.
 
+## 0.5.0 (2026-11-16)
+
+- New: `invoicer summary` and `invoicer aging` take `--customer <id>` to show only that customer's invoices, such as
+  `--customer acme`. An id that no invoice has is an error that names it.
+- New: `invoicer csv --unpaid` writes only the invoices still owed.
+- Fixed: two different customers with the same name were added together into one line of the summary. They are now
+  listed separately.
+- Changed: invoicer now needs Node.js 22 or later.
+
 ## 0.4.0 (2026-09-01)
 
 - New: `invoicer csv` writes one row per invoice, for spreadsheets.
